toggleable-transfer-verb-fill = Switch to filling
toggleable-transfer-verb-dispense = Switch to dispensing
toggleable-transfer-popup-filling = Now filling: containers pour into it.
toggleable-transfer-popup-dispensing = Now dispensing: containers draw from it.
toggleable-transfer-examine-filling = Transfer mode: [color=lightblue]filling[/color]. Containers used on it pour into it.
toggleable-transfer-examine-dispensing = Transfer mode: [color=orange]dispensing[/color]. Containers used on it draw from it.
